Record the tailnet name of a managed session's runner Pod.

When OMNIGENT_TAILSCALE_TAILNET is set (e.g. tail1234.ts.net), a managed
launch and every wake store omnigent-<first 8 hex of the host id>.<tailnet>,
the name the runner image joins Tailscale as, in the omnigent.tailscale_host
session label for page loads, and broadcast it as a session.tailscale event.
Best-effort: a failed write is logged and the launch carries on.
Applies after 0002-rate-limits.patch. Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

